  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kumasi Juice Production</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kumasi Juice BV makes juice coming from a former waste product, namely the pulp of the cocoa fruit from Ghana. More or less by accident they found out that this juice is actually very tasty. Kumasi Juice grew out of that which now provides for a completely new and additional income stream to cocoa farmers. With the pre-financing of DGGF the company is able to purchase juice and be able to bottle it and sell it. With this loan the company will directly support 5 Field Officers working in Ghana with the farmers and indirectly support around 300 farmers by purchasing the pulp.</narrative>
  </description>
